<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine Central Bank places $169 mln in repos.</title>
<headline>Argentine Central Bank places $169 mln in repos.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Central Bank said Friday it placed $169 million in overnight repurchase agreements at 9.0 percent against government bonds.</p>
<p>In the interbank market, call money rose to 8.0 percent from 7.38 percent at the close Thursday.</p>
<p>The U.S. dollar fell to 0.99940 pesos from 0.99982 pesos.</p>
<p>((-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0657))</p>
</text>
